// Title: Potential Binary Proxy Execution Via VSDiagnostics.EXE
// Rule ID: ac1c92b4-ac81-405a-9978-4604d78cc47e
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_vsdiagnostics_execution_proxy.yml
//
